  2+++64E6              ; Project127 ATM physical-page manager
  3+++64E6              ; ATM RAM: 64 x 16 KiB pages, mapped through four 16 KiB CPU windows.
  4+++64E6              ;
  5+++64E6              ; Public request ABI:
