 11+++64E6              ; a 32-bit byte offset; page numbers and the 16 KiB mapping window are private.
 12+++64E6              ; READ/WRITE/STREAM operations will use the same mapper and split internally.
 13+++64E6              ;
 14+++64E6              ; Reserved pages are based on the Project112 ATM2+ memory map and the P127
 15+++64E6              ; boot runtime: page 0 system/BASIC map, page 2 host stack, page 5 host image,
